{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-35","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：平面与角与线段","englishTitle":"If there be two equal plane angles, and on their vertices there be set up elevated straight lines containing equal angles with the original straight lines respectively, if on the elevated straight lines points be taken at random and perpendiculars be drawn from them to the planes in which the original angles are, and if from the points so arising in the planes straight lines be joined to the vertices of the original angles, they will contain, with the elevated straight lines, equal angles.","book":11,"number":35,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.35","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.35/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":35,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","contentId":"euclid-11-35","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"561e632371c605599198ae60311aab298c8ecd45b8f089eafa9b606aa81aae11","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-35.statement","euclid-11-35.construction.1","euclid-11-35.construction.2","euclid-11-35.proof.1","euclid-11-35.proof.2","euclid-11-35.proof.3","euclid-11-35.proof.4","euclid-11-35.proof.5","euclid-11-35.proof.6","euclid-11-35.proof.7","euclid-11-35.proof.8","euclid-11-35.proof.9","euclid-11-35.proof.10","euclid-11-35.proof.11","euclid-11-35.proof.12","euclid-11-35.proof.13","euclid-11-35.proof.14","euclid-11-35.proof.15","euclid-11-35.proof.16","euclid-11-35.proof.17","euclid-11-35.proof.18","euclid-11-35.proof.19","euclid-11-35.proof.20","euclid-11-35.proof.21","euclid-11-35.proof.22","euclid-11-35.proof.23","euclid-11-35.conclusion","euclid-11-35.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-35.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"48a592b2bd0819090ca0a082fba00e86d309d0016b283624eb5bc34fc7a3a75c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If there be two equal plane angles, and on their vertices there be set up elevated straight lines containing equal angles with the original straight lines respectively, if on the elevated straight lines points be taken at random and perpendiculars be drawn from them to the planes in which the original angles are, and if from the points so arising in the planes straight lines be joined to the vertices of the original angles, they will contain, with the elevated straight lines, equal angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个等值平面角度,在它们的顶端设置高直线,其中分别包含与原始直线相同的角,如果在高直线点上随机划入,直线点从它们直径划入最初角所在的平面点,如果从平面直线中产生的点与原始角的顶端连接,它们将包含平等的角,与高直线连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"254043cd41eb6643b42c96be3d1eef00b6065e16dc5b34f902c5c67dd32ad6aa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angles BAC, EDF be two equal rectilineal angles, and from the points A, D let the elevated straight lines AG, DM be set up containing, with the original straight lines, equal angles respectively, namely, the angle MDE to the angle GAB and the angle MDF to the angle GAC, let points G, M be taken at random on AG, DM, let GL, MN be drawn from the points G, M perpendicular to the planes through BA, AC and ED, DF, and let them meet the planes at L, N, and let LA, ND be joined; I say that the angle GAL is equal to the angle MDN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让BAC、EDF角为两个等直线角,从A、D点起,让AG、DM高直线分别包含相同角度,即MDE角至GAB角,MDF角至GAC角,G、M角随机取AG、DM点至GL点,GL点至G点、M直线至平面点至BA、AC和ED角至DF,DF点,并让MN点从G、M点抽取,G、M直线至平面至BA、AC和DF点,依此作图。L,N,平面相交,LA,ND连接;我说,GAL角等于MDN角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94bed713f130385cdca49c83b28fc465e5cc1d3e52deb89790b77708b2f23457","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AH be made equal to DM, and let HK be drawn through the point H parallel to GL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AH等于DM,让HK通过H点与GL点平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3af005a55de9ec751394725eafd6f1a94b739c3d7e28f0b14bd049e05770303e","citations":["euclid-11-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But GL is perpendicular to the plane through BA, AC; therefore HK is also perpendicular to the plane through. BA, AC. [[XI. 8](/principles/euclid-11-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但GL与平面至BA有直线关系,AC;因此,HK与平面至BA有直线关系。 [[XI. 8](/principles/euclid-11-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8034f992bdbfec4a605b3ca3e8d87803f128db1d7b7c78897a9e9df240f5dc12","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"From the points K, N let KC, NF, KB, NE be drawn perpendicular to the straight lines AC, DF, AB, DE, and let HC, CB, MF, FE be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从K、N点、KC、NF、KB、NE点划入AC、DF、AB、DE直线,HC、CB、MF、FE点连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"62191fd43ca09a4655b5fc79d9af168cc97e1e450b067f7de0835dcdc0cd05dc","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since the square on HA is equal to the squares on HK, KA, and the squares on KC, CA are equal to the square on KA, [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] therefore the square on HA is also equal to the squares on HK, KC, CA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于HA比正方形等于HK比正方形,KA,正方形等于KA,CA等于正方形,因此HA比正方形等于HK,KC比CA。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d997287e3a1b921bb19be730addbef5a621e77a50f5d5a8c6c271a2973b20eb","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on HC is equal to the squares on HK, KC; [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] therefore the square on HA is equal to the squares on HC, CA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但HC的正方形等于HK、KC的正方形;因此HA的正方形等于HC、CA的正方形。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f3c291ce8f16a69d1da044e21a2a1e092621ef664a144ce8734a57410310cd81","citations":["euclid-1-48"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle HCA is right. [[I. 48](/principles/euclid-1-48)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,HCA的该角是直角。 [[I. 48](/principles/euclid-1-48)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"694c48fc19c0ad1f96adcd5c8614be4b12c59261b425a6e88e12d98302dda100","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angle DFM is also right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,DFM的角度也是对的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be4190b93fcea54b878e547edb4e79c149f2bdebd5deba012b2569fc85302845","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle ACH is equal to the angle DFM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ACH角等于DFM角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23081cfb4ff23c5d7d442a17737a801b24ecf622030cb16b637b03e4fa043339","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle HAC is also equal to the angle MDF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但HAC角也等于MDF角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58dfb5c541459ba689afecf67b60162e5b440b65655b8d3ba949edbca7670e80","citations":["euclid-1-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore MDF, HAC are two triangles which have two angles equal to two angles respectively, and one side equal to one side, namely, that subtending one of the equal angles, that is, HA equal to MD; therefore they will also have the remaining sides equal to the remaining sides respectively. [[I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,MDF,HAC是两个三角形,两个角分别等于两个角度,一个角等于一个方,即一个角等于HA等于MD;因此,它们其余的两面也分别等于其余两边。 [[I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2078be1d1ea7d3b216fd312c5d9647ac24814202849297ccda541fdd5c4cdb3f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AC is equal to DF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AC等于DF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6e461fcdf0a33275ab1fe659739781eff5ec8ee74fc3190d46f6f081012a380","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that AB is also equal to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,AB也等于DE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f5f470480790506701583b035125041ef89dbb9dd40d29ae3df1c6e8193035a2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then AC is equal to DF, and AB to DE, the two sides CA, AB are equal to the two sides FD, DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那时以来,AC等于DF,AB等于DE,双方CA等于FD,DE等于双方。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"00ff5cb2a72b964c753cc9651ce4646f9d9f03f1b9fb7e8690216c99e3391f9d","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle CAB is also equal to the angle FDE; therefore the base BC is equal to the base EF, the triangle to the triangle, and the remaining angles to the remaining angles; [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)] therefore the angle ACB is equal to the angle DFE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角度CAB也等于角度FDE;因此,角度底边 BC等于底边 EF,三角形与三角形之间,其余角度与剩余角度之间;因此,角度ACB等于角度DFE。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3197f0e1b7ee392147c775db5ec76693046a03f9ac71523622527e592e1eded7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the right angle ACK is also equal to the right angle DFN; therefore the remaining angle BCK is also equal to the remaining angle EFN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,直角 ACK也等于直角 DFN;因此,其余的BCK角也等于其余的EFN角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"26cdae1a20cf54e0134b6eb284489fc68d31f3bb1cf27cb6e3a27ba8239cb0ef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angle CBK is also equal to the angle FEN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,CBK角也等于FEN角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a4d043bcdd44f0faf36fce1885462dc23ea08caf050d399bf4195b60e8677934","citations":["euclid-1-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BCK, EFN are two triangles which have two angles equal to two angles respectively, and one side equal to one side, namely, that adjacent to the equal angles, that is, BC equal to EF; therefore they will also have the remaining sides equal to the remaining sides. [[I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BCK,EFN是两个三角形,两个角分别等于两个角度,一个面等于一个侧,即接近平等角度,即BC等于EF;因此,它们也拥有其余方等于其余方。 [[I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ab2698e36c6cdfd03a28ca96238a966a752a7223d45a0a7a1104b789109553d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CK is equal to FN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CK等于FN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98f0e4b406ef58951a543af083756c2208d754c1503554bd2b5515026a3d7938","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AC is also equal to DF; therefore the two sides AC, CK are equal to the two sides DF, FN; and they contain right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AC也等于DF;因此,双方AC,CK等于双方DF,FN;它们包含直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1e25903e2beb440fa45c94efcba71f9c8e87369524aaeedf8ed0017dbfb179a","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the base AK is equal to the base DN. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,底边 AK等于底边 DN。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8c52471973930d03d6054dc3166306f1593a1ba3b8423e5cce34fd3b02118de3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AH is equal to DM, the square on AH is also equal to the square on DM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AH等于DM,AH等于正方形等于DM。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7995f4e1b4599b2f7a8ca130e4fe4ead233e59afc18429597da4a962988fec9","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the squares on AK, KH are equal to the square on AH, for the angle AKH is right; [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] and the squares on DN, NM are equal to the square on DM, for the angle DNM is right; [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] therefore the squares on AK, KH are equal to the squares on DN, NM; and of these the square on AK is equal to the square on DN; therefore the remaining square on KH is equal to the square on NM; therefore HK is equal to MN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AK,KH的正方形等于AH的正方形,AKH是正确的角度;DN,NM的正方形等于DM的正方形,DNM是正确的角度;因此,AK,KH的正方形等于DN,NM的正方形;在AK的正方形中,DN的正方形等于正方形;因此,KH的其余正方形等于NM的正方形;因此,HK等于MN。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4293580440c8e3846fccd0988583bcdec0401a2e48492d632167e34e85e79ea2","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the two sides HA, AK are equal to the two sides MD, DN respectively, and the base HK was proved equal to the base MN, therefore the angle HAK is equal to the angle MDN. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于双方HA,AK分别等于双方MD,DN,底边,HK被证明等于底边,MN,因此,角度HAK等于角度MDN。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":26,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f7fcfa67256f85b2a745e4e7b4f991ed234870d1104ef5ffec2feb82267561b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that, if there be two equal plane angles, and if there be set up on them elevated straight lines which are equal and contain equal angles with the original straight lines respectively, the perpendiculars drawn from their extremities to the planes in which are the original angles are equal to one another. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"质谱。 从这一点可以看出,如果两个等同平面角度,如果在它们上面设置了两个等同的直线,并且分别包含与原始直线相同的角,则从它们之间的距离到最初角为平面的直径之间的垂直线是等同的。 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-35.source","contentId":"euclid-11-35","revisionId":"euclid-11-35@raw-561e632371c60559","order":27,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"954af69966ed9f58c7f2394be0d01cebec9f04b07ae1f23a38e5007511c57224","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.35/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.35\nCorp